// The Ledger's own section prototypes: the seven-part Racer, CargoB and CargoA
// craft cut from the Kenney Space Kit (CC0, credited in `credits/CREDITS.md`).
//
// These moved OUT of the base game (task 20260824-125959) when the built-in
// campaign took on its block-built identity. They are the mod's whole point:
// custom GLB art, custom prototypes and a fleet the base game does not own, so
// The Ledger reads as a different game from the campaign next to it.
//
// Hand-authored RON, not generated - `content -- gen` writes `assets/base/**`
// and nothing under `webmods/`. Meshes are `self://gltf/parts/<craft>/<part>.glb`
// in this folder; every sound is borrowed from base with `dep://base/sounds/`.
// A turret mount is not a prototype here either: a craft names where a gun goes
// and base's shared `pdc_kinetic_turret_section` is the gun.
